        "end": 269,
        "quote": "In a study of 64 patients (48 kindreds), 62 had germline mutations at known hotspots in RET. Patients with RET M918T mutation were associated with MEN 2B subtype and developed larger and more aggressive medullary thyroid cancer compared to other genotypes (e.g. C618S)."
